{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51819","headline":"游北岩（句） · 李渭","name":"游北岩（句）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淮阳清净理，永嘉山水心。\n（《蜀中名胜记》八《成都府·资县》）（〖1〗《新唐书·宰相世系表》赵郡李氏东祖房有李渭，爲长洲主簿李暄之子。\n《蜀中名胜记》卷八引《蜀志补遗》云：「唐李渭爲刺史，有游山诗云〖诗略〗。\n刻於等慈寺壁。\n」另参後文。\n〖2〗《舆地纪胜》卷一五七云：「李渭爲本州刺史，有诗刻留等慈寺。\n时与前进士崔公辅同游，崔有诗略曰：淮阳清静理，永嘉山水心。\n」二句诗颂扬刺史善政多才，以崔作爲近是。\n崔公辅爲杜甫同时人，详《全唐诗续拾》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李渭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51819.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51819","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}